  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "BE32B2458977D5E2",
      "text": "Bienvenue à l’Arène de Jarramanca,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "BE32B3458977D795",
      "text": "Souhaitez-vous affronter le Champion Kombu,\\nle Cordon Bleu Marine ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "BE32B0458977D27C",
      "text": "Dans ce cas, veuillez me suivre, je vous prie.\\nJe vais vous conduire jusqu’au terrain de combat.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "BE32B1458977D42F",
      "text": "Très bien. N’hésitez pas à revenir me voir\\ndès que vous serez prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_boy_entry_01",
      "hash64": "A66AD42AF62B610B",
      "text": "Allez, Kombu ! Tu veux bien jouer avec nous ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_woman_entry_01",
      "hash64": "3EB8108C114F97B3",
      "text": "Et me feriez-vous l’honneur de tester le nouveau\\nmenu de mon restaurant ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_entry_01",
      "hash64": "9DC5825CD21ED7A0",
      "text": "Désolé la compagnie, mais pas tout de suite !\\nJ’ai du pain sur la planche, là ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_entry_02",
      "hash64": "9DC5855CD21EDCB9",
      "text": "Allez, attendez-moi un peu plus loin, d’accord ?\\nOn voudrait pas faire attendre notre invité[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_girl_entry_01",
      "hash64": "43B5DA4BCCC05C43",
      "text": "Booon, d’accord !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "5DF008B7D2FAC2E1",
      "text": "Oh, c’est toi ? Prends place ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_02",
      "hash64": "5DF005B7D2FABDC8",
      "text": "Tu m’as rendu un fier service, à Porto Marinada ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "5DF006B7D2FABF7B",
      "text": "Je vais pouvoir préparer des plats délicieux\\navec ces algues wakamé légendaires !\\r\\nEt c’est grâce à toi ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "5DF00BB7D2FAC7FA",
      "text": "Par contre, va pas croire que ça va te donner\\ndroit à un traitement de faveur sur le terrain ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "5DF00CB7D2FAC9AD",
      "text": "[EMPTY 28]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "5DF009B7D2FAC494",
      "text": "Aux enchères, on se bat avec de l’argent,\\nmais dans une Arène, c’est en attaquant ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_07",
      "hash64": "5DF00AB7D2FAC647",
      "text": "Mes capacités et mes techniques créent\\ndes remous jusqu’aux fonds océaniques ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_08",
      "hash64": "5DEFFFB7D2FAB396",
      "text": "Mes Pokémon Eau vont te concocter un menu\\nentrée, plat et dessert ; tu vas déguster ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_09",
      "hash64": "5DF000B7D2FAB549",
      "text": "Mouah ha ha ! J’ai perdu, mais cet affrontement\\na été aussi rafraîchissant que les embruns ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_10",
      "hash64": "5DF38DB7D2FDDAB7",
      "text": "À tes yeux, j’étais rien de plus qu’un misérable\\nMagicarpe, pendant ce combat, pas vrai ?[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_11",
      "hash64": "5DF38CB7D2FDD904",
      "text": "Allez, c’est la fin du voyage pour moi !\\nJ’ai pas fait le poids face à toi ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_12",
      "hash64": "5DF38FB7D2FDDE1D",
      "text": "T’as su ferrer la victoire et t’as rien lâché\\njusqu’à la fin ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_13",
      "hash64": "5DF38EB7D2FDDC6A",
      "text": "Et maintenant, une petite photo pour la remise\\nde ton Badge !\\c\\nJ’ai prévu une pose pour l’occasion !\\nJ’suis content de pouvoir enfin la montrer ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_badge",
      "hash64": "49E5EBF085F3C8A5",
      "text": "Avec [VAR 0x0200(0001)] Badge[VAR 0x1101(0001,0100)]s d’Arène, tu peux capturer plus\\nfacilement les Pokémon jusqu’au niveau [VAR 0x0201(0002)],\\r\\net ils t’obéiront.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
