    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_badge_all",
      "hash64": "D1F9A566E5D769DD",
      "text": "Maintenant que t’as huit Badges d’Arène,\\ntu peux capturer n’importe quels Pokémon,\\r\\net ils t’obéiront tous ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_waza",
      "hash64": "3DC23664F56B2577",
      "text": "Et voilà un autre petit cadeau ! Je sais que\\nt’en feras bon usage.\\c\\nEn plus, c’est une belle affaire pour toi, puisque\\nc’est gratuit ! Ma générosité me perdra...[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
